      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "This data collection consists of images acquired in preparation for NRG-1308, a phase 3 randomized trial to compare overall survival after photon versus proton chemoradiation therapy for inoperable stage II-IIIB NSLC. The images include IMRT photon and proton scans. A detailed summary of the full trial from which these patients were included can be found at https://www.rtog.org/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=3RSqqdM8P-0%3D&amp;tabid=290.",
